// World-unit quantities (range, splash) are expressed against the board's
// tile, which is 128 units in Green TD v36.0 -- four times the 32 the
// vertical slice used. Every one of them moved by that factor when the real
// board landed, so a tower still covers the same *number of tiles* of lane as
// it did before. This is a units conversion, not a retune: the balance pass
// that decides whether those numbers are any good is test-014 in 12-testing.
